# Same metadata as .zenodo.json (which Zenodo reads): keep the two in step.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use zotero-backup, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "zotero-backup: backup and restore of Zotero libraries, keeping the item keys"
abstract: >-
  Back up and restore Zotero libraries (personal library and groups) through
  the Zotero web API, keeping the item keys, so restored items are the same
  items and citations in Word, LibreOffice and Google Docs keep working.
authors:
